.TH "RK\-YAZI\-PKG Reference" "" "" ""
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]ya pkg add <id>\f[R]: Install a plugin and add it to
\f[CR]\(ti/.config/yazi/package.toml\f[R] (e.g.,
\f[CR]ya pkg add yazi\-rs/plugins:toggle\-pane\f[R])
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]ya pkg install\f[R]: Install all plugins in
\f[CR]package.toml\f[R] at their pinned revisions (e.g., to sync plugins
on another machine)
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]ya pkg upgrade\f[R]: Upgrade all plugins to their latest revisions
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]ya pkg list\f[R]: List installed plugins
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]ya pkg delete <id>\f[R]: Delete a plugin
.SH Pinning a Revision
To pin an older revision:
.IP "1." 3
In \f[CR]package.toml\f[R], set \f[CR]rev\f[R] to the revision and set
\f[CR]hash = \(dq\(dq\f[R]
.IP "2." 3
Run \f[CR]ya pkg install\f[R], which installs that revision and fills in
\f[CR]hash\f[R]
.PP
\f[CR]ya pkg upgrade\f[R] moves pinned plugins back to their latest
revisions.
